      "writtenOn": "2021-01-29T22:07:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This needs to be added for all Volteer variants that implement USB4.\n\nA better alternative would be to add a field to struct usb_mux_driver. Maybe something like \"bool retimer_fw_update_supported\".  Then add a new function in usb_mux.c that walks the mux_ptr list (like usb_mux_hpd_update) and checks if any mux has this flag set.  Architecturally this is better because it couples the FW update support directly in the USB mux driver and no board overrides are needed.\n\nThis should be added as a separate CL, and as the parent to this CL.",
